libnbcompat: use selected diagnostics and correctly declare printf probe functions.

Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted), not submitted upstream.
Keep ordinary diagnostics and all feature tests. The configure.ac AS_UNAME
transform and the generated block carry the same selected source hook.
Declare strcmp in both long-long printf probes so strict C compilers test
format support rather than rejecting an implicit function declaration.
Canonical Autoconf regeneration remains a separate SDK generator check.

